BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Asheville Introverts
UID:event_314786083@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260623T041254Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260705T161500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260705T181500
SUMMARY:Fantasy and Sci-Fi Silent Book Club
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Introverts\nBOYB - Bring Your Own Book and rant or r
 ave about your current Fantasy or Sci-fi titles! We will either be in the 
 large room inside or out back on the patio depending on weather.\n\n**What
  is a Silent Book Club?**\nReferred to as "Introvert's Happy Hour"\, Silen
 t Book clubs allow readers to engage with each other without the commitmen
 t of reading a shared title. Community members gather in the same place\, 
 have some casual chit chat\, and then read silently together. **This group
  will focus on Fantasy and Sci-Fi titles (subgenres & related genres are w
 elcome!)**\n\n**How does it work?**\nFor the first 15-30 mins we will gath
 er and engage in introductions. Feel free to discuss your recent favorites
 \, mention a title that lives in your head rent free\, or ask for recommen
 dations! The best part of the Silent Book Club is being able to talk shop 
 with other readers!\n\nOnce settled in we will dedicate 45 minutes to sile
 nt reading. Your book can be traditional\, ebook\, or audiobook. Read at y
 our own pace!\n\nAfterwards we will go around show-and-tell style and shar
 e what we read with the group. Feel free to share as much or as little as 
 you want! Organic dialogue welcome!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/asheville-introverts/events/314786083
 /
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260514T160646Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260514T160646Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Asheville Introverts
UID:event_314228721@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260623T041254Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260710T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260710T230000
SUMMARY:Taming of the Shrew by Montford Players
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Introverts\nIn lively Padua\, sweet Bianca can’t m
 arry until her fiery sister Katherina does. Enter Petruchio\, a bold suito
 r ready for the challenge. What follows is a fast-paced battle of wit\, pr
 ide\, and maybe even affection. Filled with mistaken identities\, sharp ba
 nter\, and plenty of comedic chaos\, Shakespeare’s classic comedy explor
 es what happens when two strong spirits collide. Expect laughter\, clever 
 twists\, and just enough romance to keep everyone guessing.\n\nThe show be
 gins at 7:30pm.\nStepped ground seating is free\, remember to bring blanke
 ts\, pillows\, campchairs\, etc to be more comfortable. If you’d like to
  make an online donation before the show you can do so here: [https://www.
 montfordparkplayers.org/](https://www.montfordparkplayers.org/get-tickets-
 2/)\n\nThe actors will come around at intermission for cash or venmo donat
 ions and they typically have a food and drink vendor of some kind.\n\nAshe
 ville’s Montford Park Players is North Carolina’s longest running Shak
 espeare theatre company dedicated to providing exceptional dramatic entert
 ainment for the enrichment\, education\, and enjoyment of their audiences\
 , free of charge.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/asheville-introverts/events/314228721
 /
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260411T121001Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260411T121001Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
